# Cloudflare Workers static assets headers (not served). Spec: docs/specs/static-release.md R9.
/assets/vendor/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/assets/content/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/assets/brand/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
